/**
 * Black-Box API Integration Test
 *
 * @target-controller AuthController (src/main/java/com/tainted/authuser/web/AuthController.java)
 * @target-api POST /api/v1/auth/login
 *
 * Under the project's default config (social.*.mode=mock for google/kakao/naver, toss always
 * mock), login only exercises MockSocialVerifier (deterministic, no external HTTP calls) —
 * no WireMock stub is required. See MockSocialVerifier: valid token format is
 * "valid-<provider>-<seed>", externalId = "<provider>:<seed>".
 */
@TestInstance(TestInstance.Lifecycle.PER_METHOD)
